  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Sierbahnn",
      "content": "This is a far more insidious version of the movie Bedrest from 2023, which wasn't bad at all, actually. This one has more of a Ready or Not-vibe to it with the supernatural element not being visible but being talked about. The actors are fantastic and the action works really quite well. The ending feels earned and there is some real heartbreak here. At the very very end of the movie there is a music sting that bothered me because I recognized it from another horror movie. It took me a while to figure out that it is from the End of Days, which is an interesting potential tie-in given the plot of the movie. I recommend this as it was a lot of fun.",
      "rating": 7,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-04T11:12:56Z"
    }
  ],
